# 根目录 stray EAS 文件（eas 命令误从根目录运行时生成；真实配置在 react-native/）
/app.json
/eas.json

# iOS 商店截图 deliver 布局目录（由 tooling/upload-appstore.sh 从 app-store-0*.png 生成，不入库）
docs/store-assets/ios/screenshots/

# 本地凭证（service account JSON / ASC .p8），仅本机留存，严禁入库
docs/store-assets/tooling/secrets/

# ── 商店（App Store / Google Play）自动化与 listing 资料：仅本地留存，不入库 ──
docs/store-assets/tooling/
docs/store-assets/play/tooling/
docs/store-assets/ios/tooling/
docs/store-assets/play/metadata/
docs/store-assets/ios/metadata/

